@ Index:   Body Mass Index for a given Height and Weight
@ Author:  Barry Mead
@ Version: 1
@ Source:  https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?p=44674#p44674
@ Tested:  jaymos
@ input:   Weight in Lbs in Y; Height in In in X
@ output:  BMI in X
@
# Body Mass Index
# Weight in Lbs in Y
# Height in In in X
LBL ‘BMI’
  𝑥²
  ÷

  # Convert Lbs/Sq Inch to Kg/Sq Meter
  703
  ×
  END
.END.
